# Butler Routes - Burning Steppes (Horde) completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Horde accept in the local census (3 quests, docs/burning-steppes-horde-census.md,
# key 1428, band 48-58) appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin.
# Two out-of-contract pres (4122 Grark Lorkrub for 4121, 3821 Dreadmaul Rock for 3822)
# ride dedicated when onquest mini-steps at the in-zone chain heads (the pack's
# soft-pre technique); 8998's pre 8996 is main-contracted and rides a chain note
# at Bodley, never a mini. Expedition turn-ins (Badlands: Lexlort and Thal'trak;
# Orgrimmar: Mokvar) switch frames deliberately and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/burning-steppes-horde
title Burning Steppes (Horde)
levels 48-58
zone Burning Steppes
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Eastern Kingdoms
coords live
version 1

step Grark Lorkrub camp - the Grark chain head (soft pre)

  zone map 1428

  when onquest 4122

  tip Grark Lorkrub holds his camp at (40.2, 34.24); his errand turns in here.
  turnin 4122 -- Grark Lorkrub - the word to Grark Lorkrub
  accept 4121 -- Precarious Predicament - Grark Lorkrub; the escort runs the northwest road, below
  note 4122 accepts at Lexlort in the Badlands (uncontracted; its 4081>4082 pre-chain is named in the census, not routed).

step The northwest road - the Prisoner Transport escort

  zone map 1428

  complete 4121 @25.73,27.1 era -- the Prisoner Transport escort on the northwest road; the Thorium Shackles come with the escort
  note The turn-in leaves the zone (Badlands expedition below).

step Blackrock Mountain - Bodley's finale

  zone map 1428

  tip Bodley waits on the mountain at (32.2, 25.8) - one of his three placed points in the data.
  accept 8998 -- Back to the Beginning - Bodley; the word goes to Mokvar in Orgrimmar (expedition below)
  note 8996 (Return to Bodley) is contracted in the main Burning Steppes guide - bring it done from Bodley's leg there; this guide does not re-route it.

step Sha'ni's camp - the nose-ring chain head (soft pre)

  zone map 1428

  when onquest 3821

  tip Sha'ni Proudtusk holds her camp at (79.95, 45.4) - her only spawn anywhere in the data.
  turnin 3821 -- Dreadmaul Rock - the word to Sha'ni Proudtusk
  accept 3822 -- Krom'Grul - Sha'ni Proudtusk; Krom'Grul waits just south of the camp
  note 3821 accepts at Thal'trak in the Badlands (uncontracted, named in the census).

step The east camp - Krom'Grul

  zone map 1428

  complete 3822 @79.66,47.43 era -- Sha'ni's Nose-Ring off Krom'Grul (100% at his single point, south of Sha'ni)
  note The turn-in leaves the zone (Badlands expedition below).

step Badlands expedition - Lexlort's word

  zone map 1418

  when onquest 4121

  turnin 4121 -- Precarious Predicament - the word to Lexlort @5.88,47.63 era
  zone map 1428

step Badlands expedition - Thal'trak's nose-ring

  zone map 1418

  when onquest 3822

  turnin 3822 -- Krom'Grul - the nose-ring to Thal'trak Proudtusk @3.36,48.06 era
  zone map 1428

step Orgrimmar expedition - Mokvar's word

  zone map 1454

  turnin 8998 -- Back to the Beginning - the word to Mokvar @34.95,38.29 era
  zone map 1428
